    "title": "Practical Restaurant Automation for Central Florida",
    "description": "Where restaurant teams can use automation for routine information, operational handoffs, and planning, with careful handling of orders, exceptions, and guest needs.",
    "date": "2026-01-31",
    "author": "Vektar team",
